# dotfiles-desktop
# Clipboard history, expired: every half hour, what was stored before the
# last run goes (hypr/scripts/clipboard.sh expire), so an entry lives half an
# hour to an hour. cliphist keeps no times, so the age is counted in runs.
# Logout takes the rest: the history is on tmpfs (config/env.lua).
[Unit]
Description=Clipboard history expiry
PartOf=hyprland-session.target
After=hyprland-session.target

[Timer]
OnActiveSec=30min
OnUnitActiveSec=30min
AccuracySec=1min
